              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "वसतिः — vasatiḥ — \"a night's stay; a lodging for the night\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "पथिकः ग्रामे वसतिं याचते। pathikaḥ grāme vasatiṃ yācate. The wayfarer asks for a night's stay in the village."
            },
